/* Original dialogue written for the stable-base rebuild. */
static const char*const ascent_dialogue[3][4][3]={
{{"You built a heaven out of our graves.","I climbed every damn one.","Keep your crown. I came for the head that wore it."},{"That was no throne. It was a lock.","Something below the light is still pulling my chains.","Then I keep climbing. Until there is nothing left to kneel to."},{"UNMAKER: I wrote your suffering into the stone.","WARDEN: Then watch me tear out the fucking page.","UNMAKER: You cannot kill the hand that made you."},{"You forged me to bear your chains.","You should have made them stronger.","No more masters. No more graves. We walk out of here alive."}},
{{"The choir promised I would die without a name.","Listen carefully. That silence is mine.","Tell your saints Vesper sent them."},{"The choir is dead. So who is still singing?","There. A voice behind the wound in the world.","One last throat. One last prayer."},{"UNMAKER: Every blade you carried was part of my design.","VESPER: Then you know exactly how this ends.","UNMAKER: I gave you your name. VESPER: You can choke on it."},{"You taught the world to fear the dark.","Now it knows what the dark was hiding from.","My name is Vesper. And no one owns it anymore."}},
{{"You crowned yourself with stolen stars.","I have come to collect.","Let heaven remember who brought the fucking sky down."},{"These stars are not fading. They are being recalled.","A hand beyond the throne still claims them.","It will learn the difference between a sovereign and a servant."},{"UNMAKER: I am the law that holds your heavens together.","PROXY: Then let the heavens break.","UNMAKER: Without me, you are nothing. PROXY: Watch nothing rise."},{"Your throne was a cage with better lighting.","I owe this world more than another king.","Take back your stars. The sky belongs to all of us."}},
};
